return {
    ["\n　　老师死了，工坊也倒闭了。\n　　我做不好蜡烛，也救不回老师。\n　　糖厂的工作不适合我，糖是甜的，但糖厂是发苦的。\n　　我什么都做不好，谁也救不回。\n　　“永暗的蜡烛，不毁的身躯”，<Letter_RedBig>请带走我这个无用之人吧。</>"] = "\n	The teacher is dead, and the workshop has closed down.\n	I can't make candles well, and I can't save the teacher.\n	The work at the sugar factory doesn't suit me; sugar is sweet, but the sugar factory is bitter.\n	I can't do anything well, and I can't save anyone.\n	\"Candle of Eternal Darkness, Indestructible Body\", <Letter_RedBig>please take away this useless person.</>",
    ["  很久很久以前，丰饶之树还只是一粒种子，由大地母神教会的圣者悉心保管。直到那场背弃誓言的战争将大地化为焦土，圣者落下了泪。为了让焦土重生，她将种子埋入泥土，又以己身吸纳荒芜。丰饶之树破土而出，化为稚嫩的人形灵体，裹着金色披风。她的名字叫西尔维娅。\n\n  “大地，在呼唤我。”"] = "A long, long time ago, the Tree of Abundance was just a seed, carefully kept by the Saints of the Church of the Earth Mother. Until that war of broken oaths turned the earth into scorched soil, the Saint shed tears. In order to let the scorched soil be reborn, she buried the seed into the soil and absorbed the desolation with her own body. The Tree of Abundance broke through the soil, turning into a delicate humanoid spirit wrapped in a golden cloak. Her name is Sylvia. \n \n \"The earth is calling me.\"",
