    ["　　\n\n　　知识是被扛在肩上的，它有重量，会消耗体力，背负者必须为它付出代价。\n　　这个古老民族或许比后世许多哲学体系更早地触及了一个真相——知道得越多，承受得越重。\n　　遗憾的是，现存文献大多残损。本书所能依赖的，仅有零星出土的陶片刻铭、后世抄本中的引述，以及邻近语族中若干可疑的同源词。这些材料足以暗示方向，却不足以支撑定论。\n　　笔者如实呈现证据的匮乏，而非用推测填补空白——在语源学这门学科里，承认无知本身就是一种诚实。"] = " \n \n Knowledge is carried on the shoulders; it has weight and consumes physical strength, and the bearer must pay a price for it. \n This ancient nation perhaps touched a truth earlier than many later philosophical systems—the more you know, the heavier you bear. \n Regrettably, most existing documents are damaged. What this book can rely on are only sporadic inscriptions on unearthed pottery shards, citations in later manuscripts, and several suspicious cognate words in neighboring language families. These materials are enough to suggest a direction, but not enough to support a conclusion. \n The author presents the lack of evidence truthfully, rather than filling the gaps with speculation—in the discipline of etymology, admitting ignorance itself is a kind of honesty.",
    ["　　如你所知，当下的廷根并不算风平浪静。就在几天前，我们又收到了一份郡警察厅的案件报告。经过一定的考虑和评估，我们一致认为，你是接手这个案件的合适人选。\n　　这个案件风险适中，是个不错的练手机会。在调查之余，也请你保护好自己——切记，安全第一。\n　　随信附上前期的调查档案，请仔细阅读。\n　　加油吧，新人值夜者。"] = "　　As you know, Tingen is not exactly peaceful right now. Just a few days ago, we received another case report from the County Police Department. After some consideration and evaluation, we unanimously agree that you are the right person to take on this case. \n　　This case has moderate risk and is a good opportunity for practice. While investigating, please also protect yourself—remember, safety first. \n　　Attached to this letter is the preliminary investigation file, please read it carefully. \n　　Good luck, new Nighthawk.",
